 "text": "Property Search | Emmet County, MI\nSkip to main content\n200 Division Street | Petoskey, MI 49770\n(231) 348-1700\nGovernment\nBoard of Commissioners\nCounty Boards & Committees\nCourts\nElections\nMeetings, Minutes & Agendas\nSheriff's Office\nTownships & Municipalities\nDepartments\nAdministration\nClerk\nConstruction Resources\nDPW / Recycling & Waste\nEmergency Management\nEMS\nEqualization\nFacilities & Assets\nFair\nFinance\nFOIA Office\nGIS\nHuman Resources\nInformation Technology\nMaintenance\nMSU Extension\nParks & Recreation\nPellston Regional Airport\nPlanning & Zoning\nRegister of Deeds\nTreasurer\nVeterans Affairs\nServices\n911 / Central Dispatch\nAssumed Names (DBA)\nCensus Data\nCounty Directory\nDeath Record Search\nDelinquent Tax Search\nDog License\nGIS Map\nLand Record Search\nMarriage Record Search\nOpen Bids & RFPs\nPay Fines & Fees\nProperty Search\nRecycling\nTransportation\nExperiences\nAirport\nCamp Petosega\nCecil Bay\nCrooked River Lock\nEmmet-Charlevoix County Fair\nFairgrounds & Community Building\nHeadlands\nMcGulpin Lighthouse\nTrails & Parks\nAbout\nBuilding Locations & Hours\nCounty News\nDoing Business in Emmet County\nEnvironmental Resources\nHistory\nJobs\nMeetings & Events\nslide 1 of 3\nEmmet County\nPROPERTY SEARCH\nSERVICES\nAssumed Names (DBA) Search\n911/Central Dispatch\nCensus Data\nCounty Directory\nDeath Record Search\nDelinquent Tax Search\nDog License\nInteractive Mapping\nLand Records Search\nMarriage Record Search\nOpen Bids & RFPs\nPay Fines & Fees\nProperty Search\nRecycling\nTransportation\nHome\nServices\nProperty Search\nProperty Search\nScroll Link\nIt is important to note that when searching for a property by address you may not access the correct property. Emmet County is undergoing a house numbering project that should correct this in the future. If you believe your property address is incorrect, please contact the Emmet County Ordinance Enforcement Department. For further clarification on any of the searches listed at the above web site please contact Emmet County Equalization.\nProperty Search Listing of Township Numbers and Parcel Explanation\nLIMITED – RECORD CARD SEARCH!\nThe information accessed through the link below is specifically for the following governmental units that have made their record card, pictures and building sketches available for Web display. The record card information is updated once yearly , in the spring. For current ownership information, please see Entire County Property Search.\nBliss Township\nCarp Lake Township\nCenter Township\nCross Village Township\nFriendship Township\nLittlefield Township/Village of Alanson\nLittle Traverse Township\nPleasantview Township\nReadmond Township\nSpringvale Township\nWawatam Township/Village of Mackinaw City (Emmet County)\nWest Traverse Township\nCity of Harbor Springs\nCity of Petoskey\nAll properties in Emmet County “will not” be listed at this link. Only those with record cards.\nLimited Record Card Search\nWarning and Disclaimer:\nBe advised that Emmet County makes absolutely no representation or warranty, express or implied, as to the accuracy, completeness, timeliness, or usefulness of the information contained on this, and the legal descriptions, boundary lines, ownership information, and other information contained on this site may be incomplete or inaccurate. Users of this website are hereby further advised (1) property boundary lines displayed on this website have a margin of error that may be significant in some instances; (2) the boundary lines and ownership information on this website cannot be relied upon as a legal representation of the actual boundary lines between properties or actual ownership of title to properties; and (3) boundary lines and ownership information on this website cannot and should not be used in place of a professional survey and professional title search and opinion of title. Use of the information contained in this website does not confer any type of contractual right, express or implied, at law or in equity, on users of the website and indicates your willingness and consent to release, waive, and disclaim all liability against Emmet County and its Board members, officers, employees, volunteers, agents, contractors, successors, and assigns for any and all claims, actions, damages, or judgments of any kind whatsoever arising out of the use, misuse, or dissemination of the information contained on this website.\n×\nNOTICE TO RESIDENTS\n2027 APPLCATIONS NOW OPEN: Emmet County Opioid Settlement Steering Committee (OSSC) invites organizations and groups addressing opioid prevention, harm reduction, treatment, and recovery in Emmet County to apply for funding to support programs benefiting Emmet County residents.\nView OSSC Page\nthis page\nShare this page\n×\nCopy and paste this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://www.emmetcounty.org/services/property_search.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nReddit\nClose\nNeed Help?\ninfo@emmetcounty.org\n(231) 348-1700\n200 Division Street\nPetoskey, MI 49770\nHours: 8 AM - 5 PM | Monday - Friday\nPhone: (231) 348-1700\ninfo@emmetcounty.org\n2026 © Emmet County, MI. All Rights Reserved.\nWebsite & Photography by Jake Newell.\nAccessibility\nADA Accessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nSite Map\n>\nResources\nAbout\nHistory\nVision\nPowered by revize . , the Government Website Experts | Login\nClose Read More",
